================================================================================
 THIS IS A DRAFT. It has not been reviewed by a lawyer and is not binding on
 anyone. It is a starting point modeled on the structure of the Functional
 Source License 1.1 (see https://fsl.software/), with an added small-deployment
 carve-out modeled on the license OpenWork (https://github.com/openworklabs)
 uses for its own `ee/` directory. Before this license governs any published
 code:
   1. Compare this draft against the canonical FSL-1.1 text at fsl.software
      and reconcile any differences in wording.
   2. Fill in every [TODO: ...] placeholder below with a real, confirmed value.
   3. Have it reviewed by a lawyer, particularly the "Competing Use" and
      "Additional Use Grant" sections, which are the two clauses doing the
      actual commercial-protection work.
