## 5. Definitions

"Licensor" means [TODO: confirm legal entity/individual].

"Organization" means any individual, company, or legal entity, together
with all entities that control, are controlled by, or are under common
control with it.

"User" means a distinct human account with access to a deployment of the
Software, however that deployment authenticates or identifies its users.

"Production Use" means use of the Software that is not solely for
evaluation, development, testing, or non-commercial personal use.

